msgid ""
"Taken whenever a run working for an incident ends or its pull request is "
"linked, by whoever ends it (the runner's service user, the lease reaper, an "
"administrator): the incident's chatter hears how a run working for it ended,"
" and the pull request of the branch the run pushed learns its incident and "
"is followed there. Every write is logged."
